15. **Do not touch** `docs/**`, `web/**`, `.github/**`, `src/**` (a mutant in `wt-b819-mut` is the only exception), `tests/MpsCalc.Api.Tests/Infrastructure/**`, every other existing test file, any path of an open PR; do not stack on any other lane's branch.

